      "default": "Our drive? It is all about being top-notch and mad keen on innovation that meets the mark. We sort out challenges for our clients, finding straightforward solutions, even in UI/UX design, as we are all about our clients success."
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "stat_box",
